/// AutomationRule (P2-D27) — a standing rule: a signal to watch, conditions that must all hold, one action, and
/// how much autonomy the institution granted it. `activated_by_user_id` is the institution's answer to "who
/// allowed this to run" — the one column an unattended platform is asked about afterwards. Editable rules are
/// discardable; an armed one is retired instead. Tenant-owned: FORCE RLS.
model AutomationRule {
